  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "D_DV7INFRfzgZ9bAkuC4z",
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Logic Quiz",
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {},
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "TkuoBal8OQZiifPqF2H5d",
      "type": "code",
      "content": ":clear\n\n:rule applier     {.. /> term_ i_ ..} -> {.. term_(i_) /> term_ ..} :innermost\n:rule applier/end {.. /> term_}       -> .. :innermost\n\n:rule f/1    fib(n_)       -> Big(\"1\")                     :guard AreIn({1 2} n_)\n:rule f/go   fib(n_)       -> fib(Big(\"1\") Big(\"1\") n_)\n:rule f/step fib(a_ {ValidBig b..} n_) -> fib({ValidBig b..} Add(a_ {ValidBig b..}) Sub(n_ 1)) :guard Gt(n_ 2)\n:rule f/end  fib(_ {ValidBig res..} _) -> {ValidBig res..}\n\n:rule ViewBig View(ValidBig(n.. 0)) -> Sym(Concat(Join(\"\" Reverse(n..)) \"n\"))\n\n:rule Big/Valid Big(n..) -> ValidBig(n..) :guard AreNums(n..) :innermost\n:rule Big/Norm ValidBig(n.. 0 0) -> ValidBig(n.. 0) :innermost\n\n:rule Big        Big(s_) -> Big(SplitBy(\"\" s_)) :guard IsStr(Inert(s_))\n:rule Big/Shape  Big({Strings s..}) -> Big(Reverse(\"0\" s..))\n:rule Big/ToNums Big(s..) -> Big({/> ToNumber s..}) :guard AreStrings(s..)\n\n:rule Big/Add Add(ValidBig(a..) ValidBig(b..)) -> {BigSum {a..} {b..}}\n\n:rule BigSum/Append/b {BigSum {a..} {b..}} -> {BigSum {a..} {b.. 0}} :guard Gt(Size({a..}) Size({b..})) \n:rule BigSum/Append/a {BigSum {a..} {b..}} -> {BigSum {a.. 0} {b..}} :guard Gt(Size({b..}) Size({a..})) \n:rule BigSum/Go       {BigSum {a..} {b..}} -> {BigSum {a..} {b..} 0 Inert({})}\n\n:rule BigSum/End {BigSum {} {} 0 Inert({res..})} -> {ValidBig res.. 0}\n\n:rule BigSum/Step/0 {BigSum {a_ as..} {b_ bs..} c_ Inert({..})} -> {BigSum {as..} {bs..} 0 Inert({.. Add(Add(a_ b_) c_)})} :guard Lte(Add(Add(a_ b_) c_) 9)\n:rule BigSum/Step/1 {BigSum {a_ as..} {b_ bs..} c_ Inert({..})} -> {BigSum {as..} {bs..} 1 Inert({.. Sub(Add(Add(a_ b_) c_) 10)})} :guard Gt(Add(Add(a_ b_) c_) 9)\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Universe cleared\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Added 19 rules\n"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {},
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "iBp03MUak4hxUDDftQieV",
      "type": "code",
      "content": ":set maxsteps 100000",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Max steps set to 100000\n"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {},
      "disabled": false
    },
